9. CONFLICT OF INTEREST. No officer, member nor employee of the LCCP who
exercise any functions or responsibilities in the review or approval of the Contract or the
City's performance of its obligations hereunder shall participate in any decision relating
to this Contract, which affects his or her personal interest or the interest of any
corporation, limited-liability company, partnership, or other business entity in which the
office, member or employee has any direct or indirect financial interest.
